This software originated as the MedFlow EMR built for Fajr Mission's
field clinical operations, and was later developed for MENA Health and
Fajr Scientific. It has since been renamed Firstline; the patient-facing
strings, legal copy, and branding assets that carried those earlier names
have been replaced. The names are recorded here as attribution for the
project's origin only, and no mark of any of those organisations is part
